# LLM-Wiki CODEOWNERS starter
# Copy into .github/CODEOWNERS and replace teams/users.

# Core LLM-Wiki architecture and skills
/skills/                         @org/llm-wiki-maintainers @org/security
/templates/                      @org/llm-wiki-maintainers
/docs/*security*.md              @org/security @org/llm-wiki-maintainers
/docs/*threat*.md                @org/security @org/llm-wiki-maintainers
/docs/*mcp*.md                   @org/platform @org/security
/docs/*api*.md                   @org/platform @org/security

# Workflow and CI/CD controls
/.github/                        @org/platform @org/security
/scripts/                        @org/platform @org/llm-wiki-maintainers
/package*.json                   @org/platform @org/security
/pyproject.toml                  @org/platform @org/security
/requirements*.txt               @org/platform @org/security

# Raw/source manifests and ingestion profiles
/raw/manifests/                  @org/knowledge-engineering
/raw/extracted/                  @org/knowledge-engineering
/evals/ingestion/                @org/knowledge-engineering @org/retrieval-eval

# Wiki domains
/wiki/policies/                  @org/domain-policy @org/security
/wiki/security/                  @org/security
/wiki/architecture/              @org/architecture
/wiki/runbooks/                  @org/platform
/wiki/concepts/                  @org/knowledge-engineering
/wiki/synthesis/                 @org/knowledge-engineering @org/domain-editors
/wiki/sources/                   @org/knowledge-engineering

# Retrieval, evaluation and dashboards
/evals/                          @org/retrieval-eval
/benchmarks/                     @org/retrieval-eval
/dist/*report*.md                @org/llm-wiki-maintainers

# MCP/API and publishing/export
/api/                            @org/platform @org/security
/mcp/                            @org/platform @org/security
/exports/profiles/               @org/publishing @org/security
/policies/                       @org/security @org/product-owner

# Public-facing artifacts require publishing and security review
/public/                         @org/publishing @org/security
/site/                           @org/publishing @org/security
